.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH PDFLUENT-SIGN 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent\-sign \- Apply a PAdES signature with a PKCS#12 identity
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent sign\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR> <\fB\-\-p12\fR> [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-password\-file\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-tsa\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-reason\fR] [\fB\-\-location\fR] [\fB\-\-contact\-info\fR] [\fB\-\-field\fR] [\fB\-\-visible\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Apply a PAdES signature with a PKCS#12 identity
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR
Output PDF, or `\-` for stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-p12\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
PKCS#12 identity (`.p12`/`.pfx`)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-\-password\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Password file for the identity (line 1). Without it, PDFLUENT_PASSWORD, then an interactive prompt
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-\-tsa\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Timestamp authority URL. Accepted and reported: fetching a token needs a TSA exchange the facade does not expose
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR [default: basic]
PAdES profile (only `basic` signs today)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
basic: PAdES B\-B: basic signature, no timestamp
.IP \(bu 2
t: PAdES B\-T: refused — needs `\-\-tsa`, which the facade cannot serve
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-reason\fR \fI<REASON>\fR
Human\-readable reason for signing
.TP
\fB\-\-location\fR \fI<LOCATION>\fR
Location of signing
.TP
\fB\-\-contact\-info\fR \fI<CONTACT_INFO>\fR
Signer contact information
.TP
\fB\-\-field\fR \fI<FIELD>\fR
Signature form field name (default `Signature1`)
.TP
\fB\-\-visible\fR \fI<PAGE,X0,Y0,X1,Y1>\fR
Visible signature rectangle: `PAGE,X0,Y0,X1,Y1` in points
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite the existing output file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Input PDF, or `\-` for stdin
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
